---
import './Mechanism.css';
---

<section class="mechanism paper-field" id="workflow" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
  <div class="mechanism-inner">
    <header class="mechanism-intro">
      <h2 id="mechanism-title">One case. One clear path.</h2>
    </header>

    <ol class="process-timeline" aria-label="How Austi starts a maintenance resolution">
      <li>
        <span>01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Receive a message</h3>
          <p>Austi receives an email, message or phone call from one of your tenants and opens a single maintenance case.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Create a plan</h3>
          <p>The agent evaluates the request, gathers any missing details and creates a clear resolution plan.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Start the resolution lifecycle</h3>
          <p>The agent applies your company policy, books an approved and certified contractor, and escalates anything outside its approved scope to a manager.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
